        {
          "text": "Elyo imbizi nizyakazwa zyakali kuyandisya kuya bweendeenda moonse muzisi zyanyika, nkabela wakati, Kamuya bweendeenda munyika, Mpawo bakeendeenda moonse munyika, ",
