          "text": "Ncobeni nguwe uuti yake intempele ya-Jehova, alimwi uyooba abulemu, uyookala akweendelezya acuuno cakwe cabwami. Nkabela kumbali lyacuuno cakwe cabwami kuyooba mupaizi. Bayoomvwana caluumuno boonse bobile. ",
          "type": "text",
